    <item>
      <title>Board 1.6.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 05:53:29 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>26</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
<style>body{font:13px -apple-system,sans-serif;line-height:1.45}h3{font-size:13px;margin:12px 0 4px}ul{padding-left:18px;margin:4px 0}li{margin:3px 0}</style>
<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Board updates itself.</b> It checks for a new version once a day (or now, with <b>Board ▸ Check for Updates…</b>), shows what's new, and installs it in place. <b>Settings ▸ General ▸ Updates</b> can turn the check off, or install new versions quietly when Board quits. Every update and the list of updates are signed, and Board refuses anything that isn't.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Google needs your own OAuth client, entered in Settings ▸ Accounts.</b> Builds no longer bundle one from a local config file, since published builds are public.</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
